{title: Baharon Phool Barsaao}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Shankar Jaikishan}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Bahaaron phool barsaao,
[Am]mera mehboob [E]aaya hai
[A]Mera mehboob [Am]aaya hai
[Am]Hawaaon raagini gaao,
[Am]mera mehboob [E]aaya hai
[A]Mera mehboob [Am]aaya hai
[Am]O laali phool ki mehndi
[D]laga in [Am]gore haathon mein
[Am]Utar aa ae ghata kaajal
[D]laga in [Am]pyaari aankhon mein
[Am]Sitaaron maang bhar jaao,
[Am]mera mehboob [E]aaya hai
[A]Mera mehboob [Am]aaya hai
[Am]Nazaaron har taraf ab
[D]taan do ek [Am]noor ki chaadar
[Am]Bada sharmila dilbar hai,
[D]chala jaaye [Am]na sharmaakar
[Am]Zara tum dil ko behlaao,
[Am]mera mehboob [E]aaya hai
[A]Mera mehboob [Am]aaya hai
[Am]Sajaayi hai jawaan kaliyon
[D]ne ab yeh [Am]sej ulfat ki
[Am]Inhe maaloom tha aayegi
[D]ek din [Am]ruth mohabbat ki
[Am]Fizaaon rang bikhraao,
[Am]mera mehboob [E]aaya hai
[A]Mera mehboob [Am]aaya hai
